{
  "version": "0.1.2",
  "slug": "chips",
  "title": "Chips",
  "group": "Selection",
  "order": 8,
  "summary": {
    "en": "Pill-shaped toggle buttons in a wrapping row, for filters and quick picks that apply as they are tapped. A pressed chip turns accent and a check slides in.",
    "id": "Tombol toggle berbentuk pil dalam baris yang bisa turun baris, untuk filter dan pilihan cepat yang langsung berlaku saat diketuk. Chip yang tertekan menjadi warna aksen dan tanda centang bergeser masuk."
  },
  "titleId": "Chips",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Filter by day",
        "desc": "Several can be on. The check slides in and the padding adjusts so the label does not jump.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chip-row\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Days\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"true\" onclick=\"this.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Mon</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Tue</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"true\" onclick=\"this.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Wed</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Thu</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Fri</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Sat</button>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "One quick pick",
        "desc": "Preset top-up amounts for a Trans Bandar Lampung bus card: picking one releases the others. Pair with an amount field for a custom value.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chip-row\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Bus card top-up amount\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.querySelectorAll('.chip').forEach((c) => c.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(c === this)))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Rp 50.000</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"true\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.querySelectorAll('.chip').forEach((c) => c.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(c === this)))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Rp 100.000</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.querySelectorAll('.chip').forEach((c) => c.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(c === this)))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Rp 200.000</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.querySelectorAll('.chip').forEach((c) => c.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(c === this)))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Rp 500.000</button>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Saring berdasarkan hari",
        "desc": "Beberapa bisa menyala. Tanda centang bergeser masuk dan padding menyesuaikan agar label tidak melompat.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chip-row\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Hari\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"true\" onclick=\"this.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Sen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Sel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"true\" onclick=\"this.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Rab</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Kam</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Jum</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Sab</button>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Satu pilihan cepat",
        "desc": "Nominal isi ulang kartu bus Trans Bandar Lampung: memilih satu melepas yang lain. Pasangkan dengan amount field untuk nilai sendiri.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chip-row\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Nominal isi ulang kartu bus\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.querySelectorAll('.chip').forEach((c) => c.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(c === this)))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Rp 50.000</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"true\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.querySelectorAll('.chip').forEach((c) => c.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(c === this)))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Rp 100.000</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.querySelectorAll('.chip').forEach((c) => c.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(c === this)))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Rp 200.000</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.querySelectorAll('.chip').forEach((c) => c.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(c === this)))\"><span class=\"ic chip__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check</span>Rp 500.000</button>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
